repository-code: "https://github.com/jakbuczarnecki/intergrax-ai"
url: "https://github.com/jakbuczarnecki/intergrax-ai"
abstract: >-
  Intergrax is an Agent OS and Harness AI runtime for building, orchestrating,
  experimenting with, and validating specialized AI agents in Python. It provides
  a four-tier platform (Platform, Nexus Agent OS, Agents, Applications), governed
  runtime with policy and observability, and a capability model spanning
  Integration, Tool, Skill, and Agent layers.
keywords:
  - agent framework
  - agent operating system
  - harness ai
  - multi-agent orchestration
  - llm runtime
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - python
  - ai agents
  - policy engine
  - context engineering
